span\": \"The alarm sounds locally and sends a message to the night phone\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday until 08:00 on Monday\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday until 08:00 on Monday\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The alarm panel names the unit and shows the temperature that triggered it\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"The alarm panel names the unit and shows the temperature that triggered it\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"There are three units on this floor\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"there are three units on this floor\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Two of them alarm at the same set point\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"two of them alarm at the same set point\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The reading at the moment of arrival is the one the lab needs\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"The reading at the moment of arrival is the one the lab needs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"It cannot be recovered later\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"it cannot be recovered later\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"An alarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"An alarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Ice on the seal holds the door open by a few millimetres\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"Ice on the seal holds the door open by a few millimetres\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Ice on the seal is the usual cause of a slow rise\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"is the usual cause of a slow rise\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Opening a door on a failing freezer to check the contents is the most common cause of loss in this building\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Opening a door on a failing freezer to check the contents is the most common cause of loss in this building\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Contents are moved only on the technician's instruction and only into a freezer that already has space at the same set point\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"Contents are moved only on the technician's instruction and only into a freezer that already has space at the same set point\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":94795,"type":"result","duration_ms":97474,"uuid":"61356dfa-2f87-4ae3-85c2-40e5c1a23577","ttft_stream_ms":1040,"time_to_request_ms":114,"first_content_frame_ms":1040,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
